{step:'REFERRAL CHECK • 2 OF 2',title:'One last check before you continue',copy:'If someone introduced you to The Commission, add their referral number so they receive credit for helping you join—just as you’ll appreciate future Ambassadors using yours. If you found the platform independently, you’re welcome to proceed and be your own boss.',back:'Enter referral number',proceed:'Be my own boss'}
